  "steps": [
   "Simmer the meats in the water for 60 minutes, skimming.",
   "Add the cassava, malanga and corn and cook 20 minutes.",
   "Add the sweet potato, pumpkin and plantain and cook 20 minutes more.",
   "Cook the onion, pepper and garlic in the oil for 6 minutes. Add the tomato and cumin and cook 5 minutes.",
   "Stir this into the pot with the salt and cook 15 minutes. Crush some vegetables to thicken.",
   "Serve with a squeeze of lime."
  ],
  "tips": [
   "The pumpkin melts in and gives the broth colour and body.",
   "Better the next day, like any stew."
